{
  "schema": 1,
  "voice_lines": [
    {
      "speaker": "ДАРИНА",
      "text": "Тая, спишь?",
      "id": "intro_00",
      "scene": "intro",
      "source": "scripts/intro_cinematic_v2.gd",
      "source_line": 29,
      "context": "Ночная спальня; Дарина просит старшую сестру помочь с поделкой из желудей.",
      "asset_path": "res://assets/audio158/voice/intro_00.ogg",
      "duration": 2.8,
      "bytes": 26388,
      "sha256": "277ceda47985295a507c7ae29c1e92968613d0ce0b6a5dfeb258f9cb08b075af",
      "voice": "Rachel",
      "model": "eleven_v3",
      "language": "ru",
      "task_id": "f10d7590-65dc-4da3-b185-a0bb72e01e96",
      "original_mp3_sha256": "800bfd11753b070a84afcaa4a9ba5b94b25282de188064a064cfb7470e42231c"
    },
    {
      "speaker": "ТАЯ",
      "text": "Уже нет...... Ночь на дворе, ты почему ещё не в кровати?",
      "id": "intro_01",
      "scene": "intro",
      "source": "scripts/intro_cinematic_v2.gd",
      "source_line": 30,
      "context": "Ночная спальня; Дарина просит старшую сестру помочь с поделкой из желудей.",
      "asset_path": "res://assets/audio158/voice/intro_01.ogg",
      "duration": 5.5,
      "bytes": 53641,
      "sha256": "3a8766bea70f5a6421e8d04aff43c21a4cd47d014564e0ffeb008c72325ed304",
      "voice": "Ella",
      "model": "eleven_v3",
      "language": "ru",
      "task_id": "eda66169-9b8a-4727-956f-72f4e95073ac",
      "original_mp3_sha256": "1612fc86940780c91907a45dacf29cc1d3ec5e88b986c52793cf68125562e160"
    },
    {
      "speaker": "ДАРИНА",
      "text": "Нам поделку на завтра задали......",
      "id": "intro_02",
      "scene": "intro",
      "source": "scripts/intro_cinematic_v2.gd",
      "source_line": 31,
      "context": "Ночная спальня; Дарина просит старшую сестру помочь с поделкой из желудей.",
      "asset_path": "res://assets/audio158/voice/intro_02.ogg",
      "duration": 4.8,
      "bytes": 41947,
      "sha256": "b2c110fe628eb8481421dee701199e97e37ca325603cd6cb516a22ce2997a186",
      "voice": "Rachel",
      "model": "eleven_v3",
      "language": "ru",
      "task_id": "17c7eba8-d9f2-48f7-9ae6-3e2ca63ce973",
      "original_mp3_sha256": "004270787d58ad675358b11e3c5c6b51171554066a2b94ff11454f1ebbfb913a"
    },
    {
      "speaker": "ТАЯ",
      "text": "Сейчас?!",
      "id": "intro_03",
      "scene": "intro",
      "source": "scripts/intro_cinematic_v2.gd",
      "source_line": 32,
      "context": "Ночная спальня; Дарина просит старшую сестру помочь с поделкой из желудей.",
      "asset_path": "res://assets/audio158/voice/intro_03.ogg",
      "duration": 1.52,
      "bytes": 16469,
      "sha256": "cb7bdb3745b4c101dd81254a4ca49b3db90bc2fdea190b05d26abc48145fefb3",
      "voice": "Ella",
      "model": "eleven_v3",
      "language": "ru",
      "task_id": "cac28348-62ed-413a-b7d5-1c30e4e7d3d7",
      "original_mp3_sha256": "9b8cf0e5e3793c8198e5351dc290cf5b018440ae8f961fe8feaf031107f14311"
    },
    {
      "speaker": "ДАРИНА",
      "text": "Ага...... Я только вспомнила.",
      "id": "intro_04",
      "scene": "intro",
      "source": "scripts/intro_cinematic_v2.gd",
      "source_line": 33,
      "context": "Ночная спальня; Дарина просит старшую сестру помочь с поделкой из желудей.",
      "asset_path": "res://assets/audio158/voice/intro_04.ogg",
      "duration": 2.56,
      "bytes": 26835,
      "sha256": "d9581fa5cc1811487cbd648fc11ce3b6a55cb1cfd42e162465bea3bf4757dde7",
      "voice": "Rachel",
      "model": "eleven_v3",
      "language": "ru",
      "task_id": "25bf273b-f185-48a9-932c-cb987354ecb7",
      "original_mp3_sha256": "bfb9b9cb4f89c47ebff5e3fa2f302a56c6d232b2476abc88c0698c0cdc56e56d"
    },
    {
      "speaker": "ТАЯ",
      "text": "Дарина......",
      "id": "intro_05",
      "scene": "intro",
      "source": "scripts/intro_cinematic_v2.gd",
      "source_line": 34,
      "context": "Ночная спальня; Дарина просит старшую сестру помочь с поделкой из желудей.",
      "asset_path": "res://assets/audio158/voice/intro_05.ogg",
      "duration": 2.0,
      "bytes": 21840,
      "sha256": "895ab8e6b111ab71b0a357687c9a68593dafd1787a3ed65e85f6d170169b932d",
      "voice": "Ella",
      "model": "eleven_v3",
      "language": "ru",
      "task_id": "93079c16-2ae2-4010-a25e-bf02675266ee",
      "original_mp3_sha256": "a6050ef9d79112f3040d06f4f493cd950485b587a5bbfcf65015f0a87b450d1b"
    },
    {
      "speaker": "ДАРИНА",
      "text": "Ну не ругайся......",
      "id": "intro_06",
      "scene": "intro",
      "source": "scripts/intro_cinematic_v2.gd",
      "source_line": 35,
      "context": "Ночная спальня; Дарина просит старшую сестру помочь с поделкой из желудей.",
      "asset_path": "res://assets/audio158/voice/intro_06.ogg",
      "duration": 2.56,
      "bytes": 24071,
      "sha256": "407c1e2ce77c9d81795add8e00770856b04495e6e9d6a260035992c9fafd88aa",
      "voice": "Rachel",
      "model": "eleven_v3",
      "language": "ru",
      "task_id": "b65e7a66-2168-4b1f-a3ae-d2b88c75e23e",
      "original_mp3_sha256": "e391fee69e8ee4141560f9dd6a40b31c4123b9347f8921a221b3310c1a98621e"
    },
    {
      "speaker": "ТАЯ",
      "text": "Я не ругаюсь. Просто уже почти ночь.",
      "id": "intro_07",
      "scene": "intro",
      "source": "scripts/intro_cinematic_v2.gd",
      "source_line": 36,
      "context": "Ночная спальня; Дарина просит старшую сестру помочь с поделкой из желудей.",
      "asset_path": "res://assets/audio158/voice/intro_07.ogg",
      "duration": 3.042902,
      "bytes": 32414,
      "sha256": "b8e7ddbc39b612a34c529c01e6ad01e983678aa9f42348471a8acbd525a34441",
      "voice": "Ella",
      "model": "eleven_v3",
      "language": "ru",
      "task_id": "7b79b453-393b-4385-a626-844d6ff4265f",
      "original_mp3_sha256": "f5f2d6b02c117d1f4daa9828f1cfff386dca0cb63bd95bd69186d1561b8915ae"
    },
    {
      "speaker": "ДАРИНА",
      "text": "Я хотела сама сделать... честно.",
      "id": "intro_08",
      "scene": "intro",
      "source": "scripts/intro_cinematic_v2.gd",
      "source_line": 37,
      "context": "Ночная спальня; Дарина просит старшую сестру помочь с поделкой из желудей.",
      "asset_path": "res://assets/audio158/voice/intro_08.ogg",
      "duration": 3.282902,
      "bytes": 32250,
      "sha256": "14b8346f5fe226f4a41c7ea0d7a69bfb72dd88e526c5b1a7a66aa6df0c8d713f",
      "voice": "Rachel",
      "model": "eleven_v3",
      "language": "ru",
      "task_id": "c0c58257-6c87-4183-ab07-aa7779c61412",
      "original_mp3_sha256": "3ee3aba730f89024a9fb8397cbaa92e9fd31064e3550161eed5c146a47ed3b67"
    },
    {
      "speaker": "ТАЯ",
      "text": "И что же тебе задали?",
      "id": "intro_09",
      "scene": "intro",
      "source": "scripts/intro_cinematic_v2.gd",
      "source_line": 38,
      "context": "Ночная спальня; Дарина просит старшую сестру помочь с поделкой из желудей.",
      "asset_path": "res://assets/audio158/voice/intro_09.ogg",
      "duration": 2.08,
      "bytes": 23211,
      "sha256": "5e01c39f5220260d8102c1dd0b2bd94eb2c214d7b0822347493c4830b9e0bba5",
      "voice": "Ella",
      "model": "eleven_v3",
      "language": "ru",
      "task_id": "7d174392-3c3c-4afa-829c-9eee12dbb062",
      "original_mp3_sha256": "26303a76ce16fabf62e25e4d57ac19856409f64d28936622da0b307e593fd4ef"
    },
    {
      "speaker": "ДАРИНА",
      "text": "Поделку из желудей.",
      "id": "intro_10",
      "scene": "intro",
      "source": "scripts/intro_cinematic_v2.gd",
      "source_line": 39,
      "context": "Ночная спальня; Дарина просит старшую сестру помочь с поделкой из желудей.",
      "asset_path": "res://assets/audio158/voice/intro_10.ogg",
      "duration": 1.84,
      "bytes": 20314,
      "sha256": "a39f84a0ba556f919419abc5e7d9d43cbf1f597bdc5b2761015e9fa0c8945c69",
      "voice": "Rachel",
      "model": "eleven_v3",
      "language": "ru",
      "task_id": "de1dbc99-9986-41ae-bfcb-5d4278139d87",
      "original_mp3_sha256": "219a79c93af866f991326345609f9b287ef75d7227892e9c0f0c0098ed2d25e4"
    },
    {
      "speaker": "ТАЯ",
      "text": "Из желудей?",
      "id": "intro_11",
      "scene": "intro",
      "source": "scripts/intro_cinematic_v2.gd",
      "source_line": 40,
      "context": "Ночная спальня; Дарина просит старшую сестру помочь с поделкой из желудей.",
      "asset_path": "res://assets/audio158/voice/intro_11.ogg",
      "duration": 2.24,
      "bytes": 22088,
      "sha256": "8220ac4e2e5fdd1fff2f007b7df7974b801ff0f18fb7f2374426f44a0ae21ac2",
      "voice": "Ella",
      "model": "eleven_v3",
      "language": "ru",
      "task_id": "911853ba-6265-4d72-989f-a22e55c0c176",
      "original_mp3_sha256": "210baa39740063b28a7b87e8e19a91b448d1590c0d7a8db462fce2f2eb32f206"
    },
    {
      "speaker": "ТАЯ",
      "text": "Ладно. Сделаем эту поделку.",
      "id": "intro_12",
      "scene": "intro",
      "source": "scripts/intro_cinematic_v2.gd",
      "source_line": 41,
      "context": "Ночная спальня; Дарина просит старшую сестру помочь с поделкой из желудей.",
      "asset_path": "res://assets/audio158/voice/intro_12.ogg",
      "duration": 2.4,
      "bytes": 26556,
      "sha256": "342d953aa7e3be15d9fab59a5a1abce5b10b04b0825d25a443e2c8693e2460fc",
      "voice": "Ella",
      "model": "eleven_v3",
      "language": "ru",
      "task_id": "2caefecb-22cb-4021-be74-323a0a4a241f",
      "original_mp3_sha256": "73642397ccc7b5f996658075afa7a7005def5185903e368c8fa039c2230e82b2"
    },
    {
      "speaker": "ДАРИНА",
      "text": "УРААА! А жёлуди когда найдём?",
      "id": "intro_13",
      "scene": "intro",
      "source": "scripts/intro_cinematic_v2.gd",
      "source_line": 42,
      "context": "Ночная спальня; Дарина просит старшую сестру помочь с поделкой из желудей.",
      "asset_path": "res://assets/audio158/voice/intro_13.ogg",
      "duration": 3.122902,
      "bytes": 31322,
      "sha256": "1837c4ec828e2f5160e67ba9165d68d55fa3e07a1357ab571a0e6da70e3516c9",
      "voice": "Rachel",
      "model": "eleven_v3",
      "language": "ru",
      "task_id": "ede66eb2-23b3-420c-ac28-5027a547e2a5",
      "original_mp3_sha256": "7aa897c3220ccc91ce8bae28be38c16f93f7ef4817fa38a43d7c9199356c6f92"
    },
    {
      "speaker": "ТАЯ",
      "text": "Пойду сейчас на пробежку и найду тебе...",
      "id": "intro_14",
      "scene": "intro",
      "source": "scripts/intro_cinematic_v2.gd",
      "source_line": 43,
      "context": "Ночная спальня; Дарина просит старшую сестру помочь с поделкой из желудей.",
      "asset_path": "res://assets/audio158/voice/intro_14.ogg",
      "duration": 3.282902,
      "bytes": 35268,
      "sha256": "35ab0e3722d6d98c98a40f0e4e7d66d0dfc57787cd690641d5d320d8f18f4478",
      "voice": "Ella",
      "model": "eleven_v3",
      "language": "ru",
      "task_id": "8dbf9532-e703-42c3-9522-a89c189ad531",
      "original_mp3_sha256": "b13dffa7e5cc9fa76c9ed512423107aa0d295d0c2ab277767739ba2f9e27e0cb"
    },
    {
      "speaker": "ДАРИНА",
      "text": "Обещаешь?",
      "id": "intro_15",
      "scene": "intro",
      "source": "scripts/intro_cinematic_v2.gd",
      "source_line": 44,
      "context": "Ночная спальня; Дарина просит старшую сестру помочь с поделкой из желудей.",
      "asset_path": "res://assets/audio158/voice/intro_15.ogg",
      "duration": 1.68,
      "bytes": 17582,
      "sha256": "ec89adc8d7315f501894dbea1927eebb6b11b4bb958326cfeb08f14b96a5a25d",
      "voice": "Rachel",
      "model": "eleven_v3",
      "language": "ru",
      "task_id": "ab81a4f4-93c9-498c-8bd3-c69f188051ae",
      "original_mp3_sha256": "d47bd92e6ba4a1c6e7f7612a33873a30b5b41809b16ee573bec3ca1516cae209"
    },
    {
      "speaker": "ТАЯ",
      "text": "Обещаю.",
      "id": "intro_16",
      "scene": "intro",
      "source": "scripts/intro_cinematic_v2.gd",
      "source_line": 45,
      "context": "Ночная спальня; Дарина просит старшую сестру помочь с поделкой из желудей.",
      "asset_path": "res://assets/audio158/voice/intro_16.ogg",
      "duration": 1.52,
      "bytes": 16981,
      "sha256": "acb6c4a2178d26778330e51af58f6534a0dbac47a4f16ed681adb8247bcbb6c7",
      "voice": "Ella",
      "model": "eleven_v3",
      "language": "ru",
      "task_id": "b690913c-3d5c-4673-b583-f5490bc574e4",
      "original_mp3_sha256": "dc84455c615071e6224ab87db4d21085145a72f33e5a340ca737613c28845f51"
    },
    {
      "speaker": "ТАЯ",
      "portrait": "carolina",
      "text": "Я же сказала: долгая история. Где пицца?",
      "id": "l3_aftermath_01",
      "scene": "level3",
      "source": "scripts/level3_dialogue_lines.gd",
      "source_line": 20,
      "context": "После победы над беличьим спецназом; невозмутимо забирает пиццу.",
      "asset_path": "res://assets/audio158/voice/l3_aftermath_01.ogg",
      "duration": 4.6,
      "bytes": 44318,
      "sha256": "491ad3f1a2e7798db3391e862cc611c411b35fec94c4063a3a77d775ed117502",
      "voice": "Ella",
      "model": "eleven_v3",
      "language": "ru",
      "task_id": "01ba79bd-2338-404e-baf6-03bd3e7fe29d",
      "original_mp3_sha256": "f8d371450108a6783ee0ea452245e200967c3885c8ecc5a81dac7921249b7de3"
    },
    {
      "speaker": "ТАЯ",
      "portrait": "carolina",
      "text": "Спасибо. Хорошей тебе тихой смены.",
      "id": "l3_aftermath_03",
      "scene": "level3",
      "source": "scripts/level3_dialogue_lines.gd",
      "source_line": 22,
      "context": "После победы над беличьим спецназом; невозмутимо забирает пиццу.",
      "asset_path": "res://assets/audio158/voice/l3_aftermath_03.ogg",
      "duration": 2.88,
      "bytes": 29791,
      "sha256": "31bb290b3eed5d049f33dd98282555a25cbaab5ec7c369039d934ba536077be5",
      "voice": "Ella",
      "model": "eleven_v3",
      "language": "ru",
      "task_id": "7c1d4f87-8bf5-462e-bdb5-724d9a339232",
      "original_mp3_sha256": "851e2485d4161202ec2d38126978c22f31e80e4ddc81bd753fa14c01d545ab0e"
    },
    {
      "speaker": "ТАЯ",
      "portrait": "carolina",
      "text": "Добрый вечер. Где моя пицца? Я заказывала ещё до всей этой беготни.",
      "id": "l3_kitchen_00",
      "scene": "level3",
      "source": "scripts/level3_dialogue_lines.gd",
      "source_line": 10,
      "context": "Разговор с поваром перед штурмом; усталая сухая ирония.",
      "asset_path": "res://assets/audio158/voice/l3_kitchen_00.ogg",
      "duration": 6.5,
      "bytes": 63239,
      "sha256": "151f23e8b09bd3278dfbeeeb3f0f1b7c3e669dec20a2990b052ee0e348cf354f",
      "voice": "Ella",
      "model": "eleven_v3",
      "language": "ru",
      "task_id": "f2839dad-e0eb-411f-b0b3-4141607b3e35",
      "original_mp3_sha256": "4c6f06cdb62d2b871904f852f6e7350a1bc05746d99a5c54da60549d22361196"
    },
    {
      "speaker": "ТАЯ",
      "portrait": "carolina",
      "text": "Долгая история. Очень пушистая. Пицца уже готова?",
      "id": "l3_kitchen_02",
      "scene": "level3",
      "source": "scripts/level3_dialogue_lines.gd",
      "source_line": 12,
      "context": "Разговор с поваром перед штурмом; усталая сухая ирония.",
      "asset_path": "res://assets/audio158/voice/l3_kitchen_02.ogg",
      "duration": 2.8,
      "bytes": 28852,
      "sha256": "6406a3ac7ce616f996c41cf75198f9509beb5c392a3258fae6bccbf203945336",
      "voice": "Ella",
      "model": "eleven_v3",
      "language": "ru",
      "task_id": "b31b6698-49e8-45bf-b4da-ee731c00eddc",
      "original_mp3_sha256": "b34e6de7d5c301c1cc9e0042e873f6f9099335693719215afc865380c811ccf1"
    },
    {
      "speaker": "ТАЯ",
      "portrait": "carolina",
      "text": "Поверь, белки сегодня вооружены гораздо лучше меня.",
      "id": "l3_kitchen_04",
      "scene": "level3",
      "source": "scripts/level3_dialogue_lines.gd",
      "source_line": 14,
      "context": "Разговор с поваром перед штурмом; усталая сухая ирония.",
      "asset_path": "res://assets/audio158/voice/l3_kitchen_04.ogg",
      "duration": 4.3,
      "bytes": 43788,
      "sha256": "21e9382f23f36b3271271d76f68911151940aed043d5338249cc54e0f2a9f7a4",
      "voice": "Ella",
      "model": "eleven_v3",
      "language": "ru",
      "task_id": "be54e2d5-7347-4b67-a584-2af7397bf5c2",
      "original_mp3_sha256": "0085441b814bac3da387e79bc11ba20c4ef6108db0b6e656c4c8625ff7c85b7f"
    },
    {
      "speaker": "ТАЯ",
      "portrait": "carolina",
      "text": "Эй! Здесь кто-нибудь есть? Я за пиццей.",
      "id": "l3_reception_00",
      "scene": "level3",
      "source": "scripts/level3_dialogue_lines.gd",
      "source_line": 5,
      "context": "Тая вошла за пиццей в пустую ночную закусочную и зовёт сотрудника.",
      "asset_path": "res://assets/audio158/voice/l3_reception_00.ogg",
      "duration": 3.762902,
      "bytes": 37538,
      "sha256": "6a6a352b46f48046fc36edac77b056098622921cad0604470e4da6c6a8ef43b6",
      "voice": "Ella",
      "model": "eleven_v3",
      "language": "ru",
      "task_id": "71a9a696-8530-4696-8df5-1873085d9516",
      "original_mp3_sha256": "c2d6e5e6a7c7c0ec6f1ec0fac6a47a15db43a76345463a4d1bcbbdad5560ce53"
    },
    {
      "speaker": "ТАЯ",
      "portrait": "carolina",
      "text": "Ладно. Похоже, всё самое интересное опять на кухне.",
